          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_add_04",
      "hash64": "A20960AB7E342F01",
      "text": "Tienes muchísimas ganas de ayudarme en mi\\nmaravilloso experimento, ¿verdad?[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_06",
      "hash64": "86F82B19633C9B8F",
      "text": "¡Veo que tienes todo listo! Muy bien, veamos...\\n¡Sin-cro-ni-za-ción![VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_07",
      "hash64": "86F82A19633C99DC",
      "text": "Ahora, tu Pokémon y tú estáis en perfecta\\nsincronía.[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_08",
      "hash64": "86F83119633CA5C1",
      "text": "Eso significa que se moverá exactamente como\\ntú desees.[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_09",
      "hash64": "86F83019633CA40E",
      "text": "Venga, pruébalo para salir de dudas. Haz que\\nvaya hasta ese árbol de allí.[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_10",
      "hash64": "86F4A31963397EA0",
      "text": "¡Eeeso es! ¡Estupendo! Hay que ver lo bien\\nsincronizados que estáis.[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_11",
      "hash64": "86F4A41963398053",
      "text": "¡Gracias a ti he recabado datos muy muy útiles!\\nToma, un regalillo.[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_12",
      "hash64": "86F4A51963398206",
      "text": "La verdad es que esto no se te da nada mal.\\c\\nTe voy a conceder el honor de dejarte ayudarme\\nde nuevo.[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_13",
      "hash64": "86F4A619633983B9",
      "text": "Este va a ser un poco más complicado que el\\nexperimento anterior, así que te prometo que\\r\\nte daré un regalillo bastante más guay.[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_14",
      "hash64": "86F4A7196339856C",
      "text": "¿Qué, te han entrado ganas de ayudarme\\ncon mi maravilloso experimento?[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_15",
      "hash64": "86F4A8196339871F",
      "text": "¡¿No quieres ser pioner[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa del gran descubrimiento\\nno ya del siglo, sino del milenio?![VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_16",
      "hash64": "86F4A919633988D2",
      "text": "¡Vamos allá, pues! ¡Sin-cro-ni-za-ción![VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_17",
      "hash64": "86F4AA1963398A85",
      "text": "Vuelves a estar en sincronía con tu Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_18",
      "hash64": "86F4AB1963398C38",
      "text": "Esta segunda vez deberías ser capaz de llevar\\na cabo más acciones.[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_19",
      "hash64": "86F4AC1963398DEB",
      "text": "Empecemos una prueba de combate. Intenta\\nenfrentarte a algún Pokémon en este estado.[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_20",
      "hash64": "86FEB5196341F1BB",
      "text": "¡Eeeso es! La sincronía que tenéis no se ve\\ntodos los días.[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_21",
      "hash64": "86FEB4196341F008",
      "text": "Una habilidad y un talento como los tuyos se\\nmerecen un premio especial.[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_22",
      "hash64": "86FEB7196341F521",
      "text": "Es un prototipo, así que deja mucho que desear\\nen cuanto a diseño, pero...[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_23",
      "hash64": "86FEB6196341F36E",
      "text": "¡Pruébalo! Con este maravilloso aparato podrás\\nsincronizarte con cualquiera de tus Pokémon en\\r\\ncualquier momento.[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_24",
      "hash64": "86FEB9196341F887",
      "text": "Vale, detengamos el experimento. Ven a verme\\ncuando vuelvas a tener ganas de participar.\\r\\nEspero no haberte sobrecargado el cerebro...[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_25",
      "hash64": "86FEB8196341F6D4",
      "text": "¿Has estado usando el Sincromisor?\\c\\nTe recuerdo que puedes activarlo pulsando el\\nbotón R mientras mantienes pulsado el botón L.[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s2_sub_041_synchro_26",
      "hash64": "86FEBB196341FBED",
      "text": "Has estado usando muchísimo el Sincromisor,\\n¿a que sí? No te imaginas lo útiles que me están\\r\\nsiendo los datos que he recabado gracias a ti.\\c\\nToma, unos puntos arándano como muestra de\\nagradecimiento.[VAR 0x0114(004E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
